    "_note": "PRINTED STEM SAYS '= cos 3x' BUT THE BOOK'S OWN SOLUTION CONCLUDES 'cot 3x'. The stem is self-refuted on the same page. Re-derived independently: sin 8x + sin 2x = 2 sin 5x cos 3x and cos 2x - cos 8x = 2 sin 5x sin 3x, so the ratio is cos 3x / sin 3x = cot 3x. Numeric check at x = 0.3 rad: LHS = 1.3305 = cot(0.9), while cos(0.9) = 0.6216. So the printed 'cos 3x' is a misprint for 'cot 3x'. Stem transcribed as printed, not repaired."
